1. ToLower Method

Create two variables.
Result → String
Text → String   --- "UIPATH'

Add Invoke Method activity.
Target Type → (null)
Target Object → { } Text
Method Name → ToLower

Add Message Box.
Text → { } Result

In Properties, set Method Name as ToLower, Result as Result, and Target Object as Text.

The output will display the text in lowercase.

2.Replace Method

Create two variables.

Result → String
Text → String   --- "I Like JAVA lab"

Add Invoke Method activity.

Target Type → (null)
Target Object → { } Text
Method Name → Replace

Add Message Box.

Text → { } Result

In Properties, add the parameters "JAVA" and "RPA".

Set Result → Result.

Set Target Object → Text.



The output will display the replaced text.
